  "description": "Opt-in static parity layer: one reviewer-owned operation map (which incumbent route answers the same operation as which candidate route), asserted against two static indexes in one bundle, and the verdicts that join licenses -- the stores both sides reach, a store only the incumbent reaches under the candidate's own call-graph closure, the same question left open by the candidate's residue (blocked, naming the symbol the doubt enters through), and an incumbent route a closed map does not cover.",
